</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <!-- LB-3D-HERO -->
  <canvas id="heroCanvas" hidden aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Raymond Terrace · Hunter NSW</p>
    <h1 data-ux="words">A tidy lawn, <em>without lifting a finger.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Reliable lawn mowing and yard care across the Hunter — from Raymond Terrace and Newcastle to the surrounding areas.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+61404697621">Call 0404 697 621</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#lbq">Get a quote</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-strip">
      <p><strong>Lawn mowing</strong>regular & one-off</p>
      <p><strong>Hunter wide</strong>Raymond Terrace to Newcastle</p>
      <p><strong>Easy booking</strong>call or text</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="tgm-services" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">Services</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Simple, reliable lawn care.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">Regular mowing or a one-off tidy-up — whichever your yard needs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 17h8l2-4h8"/><circle cx="7" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="2"/><path d="M13 13l4-8"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Lawn mowing</h3>
        <p>Regular mowing that keeps your yard looking tidy all year round.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Regular visits</h3>
        <p>Set a schedule — weekly, fortnightly or monthly — and forget about it.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3M4.9 4.9l2.1 2.1M17 17l2.1 2.1M19.1 4.9L17 7M7 17l-2.1 2.1"/></svg></div>
        <h3>One-off mows</h3>
        <p>Overgrown yard? A single visit gets it back into shape.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 8l2-2 2 2v12H4zM10 8l2-2 2 2v12h-4zM16 8l2-2 2 2v12h-4z"/><path d="M2 12h20"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Edges & finish</h3>
        <p>Clean edges and a tidy finish on every visit.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 19c0-7 5-13 14-14-1 9-6 14-14 14z"/><path d="M5 19c3-4 7-7 11-9"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Yard care</h3>
        <p>The little jobs that keep a yard looking its best.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h4l1 5-2.5 1.5a12 12 0 0 0 5 5L15 12l5 1v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 4 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/></svg></div>
